":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-27T08:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:08:07Z","closed_at":"2026-02-02T19:08:07Z","assignee":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nWorks fine from v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad] to v4.6.dev2.official [7864ac801]\nPerformance issues found in v4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13]\nBisected back to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700K CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nExtreme performance drop when drawing many CanvasItems with `canvas_item_add_texture_rect_region` calls.\n\n4.6dev2: <img width=\"210\" height=\"197\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8188ec4c-797b-403e-8f6b-43287c363c4e\" />\n\n4.6dev3: <img width=\"210\" height=\"187\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fabb2ba-9002-454b-a51c-b19cd6036c61\" />\n\nI had read about D3D12 becoming default in the 4.6 patch notes and tested my game with it. Noticed a large performance difference compared to Vulkan and bisected back to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHere's a tiny script you can paste on the root `Node2D` of a new scene in a new project that has `icon.svg`. Run it in the affected versions on Vulkan then on D3D12.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tRenderingServer.viewport_set_measure_render_time(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid(),true)\n\tvar bounds := get_viewport().get_visible_rect()\n\tfor i in 20000:\n\t\tvar rid := RenderingServer.canvas_item_create()\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_add_texture_rect_region( rid, Rect2( Vector2( -16, -16 ), Vector2( 32, 32 ) ), preload(\"res://icon.svg\").get_rid(), Rect2( Vector2( 32, 32 ), Vector2( 32, 32 ) ) )\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_modulate( rid, Color( randf(), randf(), randf() ) )\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_transform( rid, Transform2D.IDENTITY.scaled( Vector2.ONE * randf() ).rotated( randf() * TAU ).translated( Vector2( randf_range( bounds.position.x, bounds.end.x ), randf_range( bounds.position.y, bounds.end.y ) ) ) )\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_parent( rid, get_canvas_item() )\n\t\t\nfunc _process( _delta ) -> void:\n\tprint(Engine.get_frames_per_second())\n\tprint(RenderingServer.viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid()) * 1000)\n```\n\nAlternatively you can run the more involved MRP attached below and left click to switch between drawing manually and using CanvasItems.\nSwitch between D3D12 and Vulkan in Project Settings between runs to see the performance difference. No code changes are required.\n\nThere's an alternate script (`scene_alt.gd`) available that avoids `canvas_item_add_texture_rect_region` by using two textures instead and the performance with Vulkan is actually better going from 18 draw calls to 24000+ than using region rect. To run it drag and drop `scene_alt.gd` from the file browser onto the root node of `scene.tscn`, save, and run the project again. Observe draw calls going up to 24000+ to ensure it worked.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[vulkan-cpu-time-mrp_v.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24877685/vulkan-cpu-time-mrp_v.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}